; Guards_Gold_Spread
; Gold (XAUUSD) M15 Order Blocks -> M1 CISD, risk 0.50% of equity per trade.
;
; The spread guard is the only capital-protection filter with evidence behind
; it. Measured over three separate years it improved the result every time:
;
;            no guards   spread 3% of R
;   2023-24      +752           +955     (40 trades refused)
;   2024-25      -123            +21     (13 refused)
;   2025-26      +288           +586     ( 4 refused)
;   3y total     +917          +1562
;
; It is also the only guard corroborated by a different dataset: across 271
; scored trades, spread as a share of the stop had the strongest rank relation
; to outcome of any factor measured (Spearman -0.277), with the low-spread half
; returning +0.222R against +0.022R for the high-spread half.
;
; The other five guards are deliberately set to 0 here:
;   daily, weekly and equity stops never fired once in 27 runs over three
;     years - at these thresholds they are inert, not conservative
;   the streak filters cost more than they saved (streak 3 cut the best year
;     from +752 to +410) and disagree between years
;   the volatility filter was negative in every year it fired
;
; Leave the dead guards at 0 or tighten them deliberately. Do not switch them
; on at these values and believe the account is protected.
;
InpSwingMinATR=0.5
InpBOSMode=0
InpBOSBufferATR=0.1
InpATRPeriod=14
InpDispATRMult=2.0
InpDispCandleATRMult=0.8
InpDispMinBodyPct=55.0
InpDispMinRelStrength=1.5
InpMaxOBToBOSBars=8
InpRejectLegViolation=false
InpSwingLength=4
InpEnableBull=true
InpEnableBear=true
InpExtendBars=20
InpMaxActivePerDir=10
InpMaxAgeBars=0
InpOverlapMode=1
InpOverlapPct=50.0
InpFVGMode=1
InpFVGMinATR=0.05
InpRetestEnabled=true
InpMitigationMode=2
InpInvalidationMode=1
InpScanDepth=3000
InpEnableCISD=true
InpCISDSweep=false
InpCISDConfirm=true
InpCISDRetrace=false
InpCISDSwingLength=3
InpCISDSwingMinATR=0.3
InpCISDSwingMaxAge=150
InpCISDSweepMode=0
InpCISDSweepValidity=10
InpCISDLevelMode=0
InpCISDMaxSeries=12
InpCISDMaxConfirmBars=20
InpCISDMaxRetraceBars=50
InpCISDScanDepth=1500
InpConnEnable=true
InpConnCISDMode=0
InpConnRetestMode=0
InpConnMaxCISDBars=100
InpConnWarmupBars=200
InpConnMaxRetests=10
InpConnMitigationStops=false
InpTrendFilter=true
